@startuml admin-security-alerts
!include admin-common.puml
title Gestion des alertes sécurité

== Gestion des alertes ==
SecuritySvc -> SecuritySvc: Détection anomalie (ex: trop de tentatives)
SecuritySvc -> Redis: INCR failed_login:{ip}
Redis --> SecuritySvc: attempt count

alt Seuil dépassé
    SecuritySvc -> SecuritySvc: Trigger security alert
    SecuritySvc -> Redis: SET security:alert:{id} = {data}
    SecuritySvc -> DB: INSERT INTO security_alerts (type, data, severity)

    SecuritySvc -> NotifSvc: notifyAdmins(alert)
    NotifSvc -> EmailSvc: sendSecurityAlert(admins, alert)

    SecuritySvc -> Monitoring: Send metrics
    note right
    Prometheus counter increment
    end note

    alt IP blocking nécessaire
        SecuritySvc -> Redis: SET blocked:ip:{ip} = true (expire 1h)
        SecuritySvc -> AuditSvc: logIPBlocked(ip, reason)
    end
end

@enduml